WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.550
A manic giveaway host grins as a spotlight snaps on.

2
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.350
He unveils a presentation cheque almost larger than the stage.

3
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.650
The host swings the enormous board through the giveaway set.

4
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.550
The giant cheque crashes down and sends the cheap stage props tumbling.

5
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.350
He proudly pinches the real prize between two fingers: one tiny dollar.

6
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.700
The host waits for a standing ovation. One piece of confetti drifts past the dollar.
